{"id": "EUVD-2026-103062", "enisaUuid": "a6529ccd-cbf9-34c7-bde7-b8f34440f8d4", "description": "DooTask through 1.9.66 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in WebSocketDialog::checkDialog() that skips the membership check for dialogs with group_type 'okr'. Authenticated users can supply the dialog_id of OKR comment dialogs to msg__list, msg__one, or msg__send* endpoints to read and inject messages.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:10", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:10:53", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/dootask-okr-dialog-missing-membership-check", "https://github.com/kuaifan/dootask/blob/v1.9.66/app/Models/WebSocketDialog.php#L976-L978", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/dootask-through-1.9.66-missing-authorization-in-okr-comment-dialogs"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111640", "GHSA-mhf9-f2rf-r32c"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "89df4214-0190-3c29-81b6-e8f0546d6550", "product": {"name": "DooTask", "vendor": {"name": "kuaifan"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.9.66"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "eff7ecc8-b536-3c50-bf1e-e276b49cb6ab", "vendor": {"name": "kuaifan"}}], "isExploited": false}